Fluent Emoji 3D icons
=====================

Source: Microsoft Fluent Emoji, https://github.com/microsoft/fluentui-emoji
(the "3D" PNG of each emoji, unmodified, 256x256). Only the files used by
LLHS are bundled here. Licensed under the MIT License, reproduced below.

Files and where they are used
- star.png, fire.png, shield.png ........ Progress stat tiles (points, day streak, badges)
- mountain.png, triangular-flag.png ..... Progress level card
- graduation-cap.png .................... First Lesson badge
- puzzle-piece.png ...................... Skill Builder badge
- seedling.png .......................... Consistent Logger badge
- green-salad.png ....................... Balanced Week badge
- handshake.png ......................... Cohort goal challenge
- wing.png .............................. Your Wing challenge
- trophy.png, bullseye.png .............. Eat: "Your strengths" / "Your focus areas" headers
- Food pictures for HEI-2020 components (mapping in src/food.ts):
  red-apple + banana (Total Fruits), banana (Whole Fruits),
  leafy-green + carrot (Total Vegetables), beans (Greens & Beans),
  sheaf-of-rice (Whole Grains), glass-of-milk (Dairy), poultry-leg (Total Protein Foods),
  fish + peanuts (Seafood & Plant Proteins), avocado (Fatty Acids), bread (Refined Grains),
  salt (Sodium), candy (Added Sugars), butter (Saturated Fats)

